{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:41:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_8e5f710a7f714253a11f7171010b8469","id":"pg_9096d967f43d54cf8d702b262fb4e29a","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-coven-gateway-docs-plans-client-message-routing-design-m-2b262fb4e29a.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_a0c466097c67582e9a0fef9dfeb427d2"],"title":"2389-research/coven-gateway/docs/plans/client-message-routing/design.md @ 11425046d196","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:41:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8e5f710a7f714253a11f7171010b8469"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_4fe335e50ed11a94e8a7fd71b15ac2dba989a475fc560b4b74b26a3ebc499083"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The protocol includes a tool-approval flow: agents can request human approval for tool use, and the gateway replies with ToolApprovalResponse indicating approve, skip, or approve-all for the request."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a011f7c81a9e1278e455a6f50311fd3981e913f586e8ebb6e42e8b6d73345da9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agents connect over a bidirectional gRPC stream to the AgentStream RPC of the coven.CovenControl service, defaulting to port 50051."},{"claim_ids":["clm_afc8ade0ea6c85b25b4ef3e57dc11a9116bb41e606d958856d16ea0d58867ead"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"On registration the gateway returns a Welcome message containing server and agent IDs, an instance ID, principal UUID, available pack tool definitions, an MCP token and endpoint, and resolved secrets for the agent."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f1e6545c9d253fb6f03e4e8998182479064f125e8eb7ac791e80f06c6f65c845"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent-to-gateway messages use an AgentMessage wrapper (register, response, heartbeat, injection_ack, execute_pack_tool) and gateway-to-agent messages use a ServerMessage wrapper (welcome, send_message, shutdown, tool_approval, inject_context, cancel_request, pack_tool_result, registration_error)."}],"claim_ids":["clm_4fe335e50ed11a94e8a7fd71b15ac2dba989a475fc560b4b74b26a3ebc499083","clm_a011f7c81a9e1278e455a6f50311fd3981e913f586e8ebb6e42e8b6d73345da9","clm_afc8ade0ea6c85b25b4ef3e57dc11a9116bb41e606d958856d16ea0d58867ead","clm_f1e6545c9d253fb6f03e4e8998182479064f125e8eb7ac791e80f06c6f65c845"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:41:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_8e5f710a7f714253a11f7171010b8469","id":"pg_cf8d507942ac57459725ab386be220e1","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-coven-gateway-docs-agent-protocol-md-11425046d196-ab386be220e1.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanical